  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Among the races in the galactic core, few are as capable of beautiful song as the Peglaci. Their people have honed their vocal cords over millenia into some of the most advanced sound-making organs known to science. They are capable of reaching a stunning 15 to 40 octave range, depending on their familial heritage!",
    "value": "在星际核心的种族中，少有能如羊蹄族般吟唱出如此美妙歌声的族群。数千年来，他们的声带经不断淬炼，已进化成科学已知最先进的发声器官之一。依据家族传承不同，其音域可覆盖惊人的15至40个八度！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "This means that they are often capable of vibrating their vocal cords at frequencies most species are not even able to hear. Their 'songs' are even capable of calming others if they can find the right frequency. This has led to some unique talents among professionals of their species.",
    "value": "这意味着他们常能以多数物种无法感知的频率振动声带。若找到正确频率，他们的“歌谣”甚至能安抚他人。这一特质使该族群的从业者中涌现出诸多独特专长。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "Take, for example, Madame Knoshik of the Gurula Gentleman's Ranch. She uses her song to draw in suitors to her establishment over a distance of 0.25 light years thanks to state-of-the-art speakers on the exterior. She also uses this voice to keep her clients calm and well-behaved. A boon to her women-in-waiting.",
    "value": "以古鲁拉绅士会所的克诺希克夫人为例。凭借外部先进的扬声系统，她的歌声能吸引0.25光年外的访客至其场所，并以此声线使客人保持冷静与得体举止，对会所中的待客者而言实为福音。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "Then of course there is Vorlin Tae, reknowned opera Diva. She has performed to audiences across the galaxy, and many claim her shows are more intoxicating than even the most expensive street drugs. Her voice is the stuff of legends and tickets are appropriately priced for such a reputation.",
    "value": "还有闻名银河的歌剧天后沃林·泰。她的演出遍及星际，许多人称其表演比最昂贵的街头药物更令人沉醉。她的嗓音已是传奇，票价亦与声誉相称。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/4",
    "raw": "Another fine example would be the Hevlar Corps, an elite branch of the Protectorate Defense Force composed entire of Peglaci. Through special sound-based training they are capable of eliminating threats without even needing to shoot. Soothing targets to sleep, and then imprisoning them, is much cleaner than wet works.",
    "value": "赫夫拉军团亦是典例，这支由纯羊蹄族组成的守护者防御军精英部队，通过特殊的声波训练，能在无需开火的情况下消除威胁。使目标镇静入眠再行拘禁，远比血腥手段更为利落。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/5",
    "raw": "There are so many other potential applications for their voices that we've likely barely scratched the surface of what is possible.",
    "value": "对羊蹄族声音的潜在应用远不止于此，我们目前所探知的或许仅是冰山一角。"
  }
]